1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,000
Some of your RAG failures were never
broken in the first place.

2
00:00:05,017 --> 00:00:10,142
Sometimes the question is ambiguous, and
more than one answer is reasonable.

3
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:15,200
Sometimes the expected answer in your
golden set is just wrong.

4
00:00:15,817 --> 00:00:20,292
In an illustrative breakdown,
that's 10-20% of failures.

5
00:00:20,592 --> 00:00:25,217
Leave them in, and they inflate your error
rate and send work the wrong way.

6
00:00:26,217 --> 00:00:28,792
Fix the golden set, not the model.

7
00:00:29,817 --> 00:00:32,867
The full debugging method is on vidyal.ai.
